  { name: 'How AI works', text: 'What a model is, how it learns from examples, and where it goes wrong, with small things to try.' },
  { name: 'Space and the sky', text: 'Find the planets tonight, measure the Moon, and learn how we know how far away stars are.' },
  { name: 'Climate and energy', text: 'Weather, carbon and clean energy, worked out with your own numbers.' },
